patterns-to-follow.pattern:
Use TOOL_NAMES const array for type-safe tool registration.
export const TOOL_NAMES = ['memory', 'search_slack_messages', ...] as const;
export type ToolName = typeof TOOL_NAMES[number];

Track significant events via Langfuse:
langfuse.event({
  name: 'tool_search.tokens_saved',
  metadata: { deferredToolCount, coreToolCount, estimatedTokenSavings, model }
});
